  "content": "\n\n<h3><em><strong>巴西制造</strong> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b4c5f477e1655471df04174516f88081286146a7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></em></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/665f041a8a2b95b22f8a57282e1e36f1543ee9a0_0.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1706\" height=\"700\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/RE6JVPMFpV\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/88ded17ec723eff80f6785bbeda38e3c47584c48.png\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%252f%253fbusiness%253dYE3TNTVNFFKXL%2526no_recurring%253d0%2526item_name%253dBy%2bbeing%2ba%2bdonor%252c%2byou%2bcontribute%2bto%2bthe%2bcreation%2bof%2bmy%2bMinecraft%2bcontent.%2526currency_code%253dBRL\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ab71d7575902b145c54f6027017d09930124d1d7.png\" alt=\"PayPal 捐赠\" width=\"\" height=\"\"> </a></p>\n<h2><strong>关于</strong></h2>\n<p>Ornithopter Glider 是一款自定义滑翔翼模组，为飞行体验注入了全新元素。灵感源自达·芬奇的飞行器设计，这套做工精美的翅膀套装配合自定义动画、音效，并完整支持 Curios 背部槽位，让你在世界中自由翱翔。</p>\n<p>无论是探索广袤的地形还是深入险境，Ornithopter 都能让每一次飞行都充满史诗感。</p>\n<h2><strong>预览</strong></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media2.giphy.com/media/v1.Y2lkPTc5MGI3NjExcXppMHAxMW05MjdpeHVmZDR4cG55MXB4ZDhpdDNlMGZvc3psOWcxOCZlcD12MV9pbnRlcm5hbF9naWZfYnlfaWQmY3Q9Zw/7Mt4GmaLtJyyVpbXl5/giphy.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"386\" height=\"218\"></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"width:559px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/EBTCV4SWYAk?start=718&hl=en&cc_lang_pref=en&cc_load_policy=1\" width=\"559\" height=\"325\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<h2><strong>使用方法</strong></h2>\n<p>按下指定按键（默认为空格键）可充能进度条，随后“扇动翅膀”产生推进力。该推进效果拥有 2 秒冷却时间。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e28a2ff0805e5bbdde15efadf76b908719d1c7b8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"584\" height=\"169\"></p>\n<h2><strong>合成</strong></h2>\n<p>Ornithopter Glider 仅能通过 Create 模组的机械工作台进行合成。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e702784c480242452853f53948adad2835e62d8c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"475\" height=\"129\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a64f4dbb1c0a39aa4cca3c98f643b04f491f6f14.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"475\" height=\"301\"></p>\n<h2><strong>必需依赖</strong></h2>\n<p>本模组需要安装其他几个模组才能正常运行。为确保完整功能，请确保已安装以下内容：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">⚙️ Create</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2><strong>可选依赖</strong></h2>\n<p>以下模组完全兼容：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">✨ Curios API</a> 或 (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/accessories\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">🎩 Accessories</a> + <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/accessories-cc-layer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curios 兼容层</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><strong>搭配推荐</strong></h2>\n<p>搭配以下模组使用，体验将更加出色：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/distant-horizons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">🌍 Distant Horizons</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/do-a-barrel-roll\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">🛢️ Do a Barrel Roll</a></li>\n</ul>",
